{"name":"Up in the Air","hex":"#c2d5d8","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"up in the air","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Not yet resolved, finished, answered, decided or certain."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see up,‎ in,‎ the,‎ air."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/up_in_the_air"}],"entries":[{"title":"Up in the Air (novel)","blocks":[{"text":"Up in the Air is a 2001 novel by American author Walter Kirn. It was adapted into the 2009 feature film of the same name starring George Clooney."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/56/Up_in_the_Air_Cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Up_in_the_Air_(novel)","wikidata":"Q2069220"},{"title":"Up in the Air (1940 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Up in the Air is a 1940 American comedy mystery film directed by Howard Bretherton and starring Frankie Darro, Marjorie Reynolds and Mantan Moreland. It was produced and released by Monogram Pictures. It was remade in 1945 as There Goes Kelly."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Up_in_the_Air_poster.jpg/330px-Up_in_the_Air_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Up_in_the_Air_(1940_film)","wikidata":"Q7898080"},{"title":"Up in the Air (2009 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Up in the Air is a 2009 American comedy-drama film directed by Jason Reitman and written by Reitman and Sheldon Turner from Walter Kirn's 2001 novel. Starring George Clooney, Vera Farmiga, Anna Kendrick, and Jason Bateman, the story is centered on traveling corporate downsizer Ryan Bingham. Up in the Air was primarily filmed in St. Louis with additional scenes shot in Detroit, Omaha, Las Vegas, and Miami."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b2/Up_in_the_Air_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Up_in_the_Air_(2009_film)","wikidata":"Q211429"},{"title":"Atmosphere of Earth","blocks":[{"text":"The atmosphere of Earth consists of a layer of mixed gas that is retained by gravity, surrounding the Earth's surface. It contains variable quantities of suspended aerosols and particulates that create weather features such as clouds and hazes. The atmosphere serves as a protective buffer between the Earth's surface and outer space. It shields the surface from most meteoroids and ultraviolet solar radiation, reduces diurnal temperature variation – the temperature extremes between day and night, and keeps it warm through heat retention via the greenhouse effect. The atmosphere redistributes heat and moisture among different regions via air currents, and provides the chemical and climate conditions that allow life to exist and evolve on Earth."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Top_of_Atmosphere.jpg/330px-Top_of_Atmosphere.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atmosphere_of_Earth","wikidata":"Q3230"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Walter_Kirn_on_The_Virtual_Memories_Show.jpg/500px-Walter_Kirn_on_The_Virtual_Memories_Show.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Walter_Kirn_on_The_Virtual_Memories_Show.jpg/1280px-Walter_Kirn_on_The_Virtual_Memories_Show.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Walter_Kirn_on_The_Virtual_Memories_Show.jpg/500px-Walter_Kirn_on_The_Virtual_Memories_Show.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Author Walter Kirn in 2015","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWalter_Kirn_on_The_Virtual_Memories_Show.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/AnnaKendrick09TIFF-cropped.jpg/330px-AnnaKendrick09TIFF-cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/AnnaKendrick09TIFF-cropped.jpg/330px-AnnaKendrick09TIFF-cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Anna Kendrick at the 2009 Toronto International Film Festival for a panel on the film.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAnnaKendrick09TIFF-cropped.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/George_Clooney-4_The_Men_Who_Stare_at_Goats_TIFF09_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-George_Clooney-4_The_Men_Who_Stare_at_Goats_TIFF09_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/George_Clooney-4_The_Men_Who_Stare_at_Goats_TIFF09_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-George_Clooney-4_The_Men_Who_Stare_at_Goats_TIFF09_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/George_Clooney-4_The_Men_Who_Stare_at_Goats_TIFF09_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-George_Clooney-4_The_Men_Who_Stare_at_Goats_TIFF09_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGeorge_Clooney-4_The_Men_Who_Stare_at_Goats_TIFF09_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Vera_Farmiga_%40_2010_Academy_Awards_crop.jpg/500px-Vera_Farmiga_%40_2010_Academy_Awards_crop.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Vera_Farmiga_%40_2010_Academy_Awards_crop.jpg/500px-Vera_Farmiga_%40_2010_Academy_Awards_crop.jpg?utm_